# Files that Vite copies out of public/ but which should not be served publicly.
#
# Vite's publicDir copy takes every entry verbatim, dotfiles included, so this
# lands at dist/.assetsignore — which is exactly where Wrangler looks for it
# (the assets directory root, per wrangler.toml's [assets] directory = "./dist").
#
# Gitignore syntax, resolved against that root. Wrangler already excludes this
# file itself, plus _redirects and _headers, so they don't need listing here.

# Maintainer docs. public/music/README.md explains how to add tracks; there is no
# markdown under public/ that is meant to be reachable over HTTP.
*.md
